## Fruit Trees
**Bell Trees**
Trees on which the [[bellfruit|Bellfruit]] grows. These are commonly found in larger settlements. The fruit makes a soothing musical sound. People have cultivated it from its wild form, which has a less obvious sound and a sweeter fruit. Its flowers grow into a 
**Carambola Tree**
Trees on which the Starfruit grows. Naturally grows in subtropical climates, yet is able to survive with ample water. It is a invasive species. Its flowers are 5 sided and grow into a starfruit.

# Plants
**Lampgrass**
Lampgrass is a flower which is very common in dark places, i.e. in swamps, jungles or caves. When it is dark, it emits a dim light.

# Biomes Summary
## Swamp
Come in two varieties, Mangrove and Willow. Closer to the equator, Mangroves are more common.

Contains:
-   Primarily Mangrove or Willow
-   Lampgrass

## Temperate Forest
